### Fetch the server's VAPID public key (fails with 500 when push isn't configured)
GET {{baseApiPath}}/push/public-key

### Fetch the current user's registered devices
GET {{baseApiPath}}/push/subscriptions

### Register the current device (endpoint/keys come from the browser's PushSubscription)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/push/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscription-id",
  "p256dhKey": "p256dh-key",
  "authKey": "auth-key",
  "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0 Chrome/128"
}

### Rename device 1 (null clears the custom label again)
PUT {{baseApiPath}}/push/subscriptions/1/label
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "Tafel Ausgabe 1"
}

### Send a test notification to device 1
### Always 200 - the outcome is in the body: SENT / EXPIRED / NOT_CONFIGURED / FAILED
POST {{baseApiPath}}/push/subscriptions/1/test

### Remove device 1
DELETE {{baseApiPath}}/push/subscriptions/1

### Fetch the current user's notification preferences
GET {{baseApiPath}}/push/preferences

### Toggle the master switch (all devices, all notification types)
PUT {{baseApiPath}}/push/preferences/master
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true
}

### Toggle a single notification type
PUT {{baseApiPath}}/push/preferences/types/DISTRIBUTION_STARTED
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}
